WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:03.239
Your checklist puts overdue items at the top.

00:03.389 --> 00:05.993
Each one shows the date it went overdue.

00:06.143 --> 00:09.344
Below that, you see what's due in the next 30 days.

00:09.494 --> 00:14.594
Tap Add task for anything extra, or Print report to keep a copy on file.

00:15.244 --> 00:17.728
Now try it: open Checklist.
